 # Changelog
+
+## [Unreleased]
+
+### CS35L41
+
+- Added experimental CS35L51 support for Lenovo `CLSA0102` boards (subsystem `17AA:383D`) over I2C. CS35L51 shares the Halo register map, WMFW framing and DSP boot sequence with the CS35L41, so it is driven by the existing CS35L41 module with a family-level DEVID match (`0x35A00`/`0xFFFFFF00`, CS35L56 excluded) instead of a duplicate driver.
 
 ## [1.2.0] - 2026-11-06
 
